id=nemu_boot_autostart
name=Nemu Boot Guard
version=1.12
versionCode=13
author=Nemu
description=Auto-unbrick guard (3 failed boots): verified clean shutdowns reset the counter; bounded recovery with verification; only Nemu-owned suspend/disable-user/components/hidden/AppOps/standby states are restored. v1.12 sends a post-boot trigger to the app (BOOT_COMPLETED is not delivered on this ROM); on a normal boot it restores only packages carrying Nemu's suspended_by_nemu marker, and clears a marker only after a positive suspended=false readback.
